<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-Hant"><head><title>UC150 local only</title></head><body><div id="app"><main class="flex-1 space-y-6 p-6"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0 space-y-1"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">客戶入口</p><h1 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">QA UC150 Company</h1><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">2026 年度周年申報 · 到期日 2026年12月1日</p></div></div><section class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-foreground">進度</h2><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium ring-1 ring-inset bg-status-yellow-soft text-status-yellow-text ring-status-yellow/20"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-status-yellow"></span>待收文件</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">我們已收到所需的全部文件，謝謝您。</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">我們已收到您提供的 1 份文件，現正覆核，您毋須再提交。</p></section><section class="rounded-lg border bg-card p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">上載文件</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">檔案會上載至私人儲存空間，並在完成安全掃描前保持隔離。</p></div><span class="rounded-md bg-muted px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium">私人上載</span></div><div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-[180px_minmax(0,1fr)_auto] md:items-end"><label class="grid gap-1 text-sm">類別<select class="rounded-md border border-input bg-background text-foreground shadow-sm transition-colors placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60 read-only:bg-muted/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-destructive/30 h-10 px-3 text-sm w-full"><option value="identity">身分證明</option><option value="registry">登記冊</option><option value="signature">簽署</option><option value="payment">付款</option><option value="packet">交件套件</option><option value="submission">遞交記錄</option><option value="receipt">回條</option><option value="other">其他</option></select></label><label class="grid gap-1 text-sm">檔案<input class="rounded-md border bg-background px-3 py-2" multiple="" accept=".pdf,.png,.jpg,.jpeg" aria-label="要上載的文件" type="file"></label><button type="button" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-disabled:pointer-events-none aria-disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow-sm hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 text-sm">安全上載</button></div><ul aria-label="上載結果" class="mt-3 space-y-1"><li class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-md border px-3 py-2 text-sm"><span class="min-w-0 truncate">QA-resume.pdf</span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-xs text-status-green-text">已收到，等待掃描</span></span></li></ul><div class="mt-4 divide-y"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 py-3 text-sm"><div><p class="font-medium">QA-resume.pdf</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">隔離中 / 待付款</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 py-3 text-sm"><div><p class="font-medium">QA-resume.pdf</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">隔離中 / 待付款</p></div></div></div></section><a class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-disabled:pointer-events-none aria-disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-input bg-background shadow-sm hover:bg-accent h-10 px-4 text-sm active" href="/portal" data-status="active" aria-current="page">返回您的周年申報</a></main></div><script type="module" src="/@id/__x00__uc150-main.tsx"></script></body></html>